768374327280", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974480_535768377660613_1618898375524883118_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eSR5LdWyIt4Q7kNvwE-SVjr&_nc_oc=AdmNxMk9UKDSNHIuThWDOw5_nqr0o8lIokhE-dEOWPgTIYIYTgbney50C80C980ppWQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuQGgXZ6yYr5tcYox68OLpcuWgLbN-wBqOP2gUxZemSag&oe=6999BBCA"}, {"file_name": "umbrella.png", "id": "268884725149329", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001663_268884728482662_9148176858968514575_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=q7FlciXJQRgQ7kNvwGf-dSN&_nc_oc=Adk6iQGMdZCPz84GJWUKFNJc12BkBT1C-1Jc-hf1qI70VyNjHtk9U__wsU1ltL2qLjM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsFreOQaEhowvlYc40jUBk7j4o7J-ZASEEKl3-qzv3rTA&oe=69999DCB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Znanyeland - VR ", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Znanyeland is a virtual theme park, to provide a safe and cost-free theme park experience.\nImmerse yourself in a virtual game and discover a world of limitless possibilities brimming with fun and excitement. \nEnjoy the thrills and enchantment of a theme park from the comfort of your own home. \nFrom the joys of a rollercoaster ride to levitating water slides, Znanyeland is the safest way to relish the excitement of a theme park. \nThere is something for everyone! Get nostalgic and savour the thrill of it all. hop on and take a ride!", "short_description": "In these ever-changing times, we believe that everyone should be able to enjoy a theme park experience without having to leave their homes. \nZnanyeland is a specially designed virtual theme park, tailored to accomplish just that. Our goal is to design this carnival with a safe environment to enjoy a theme park experience at the comfort of their own homes.\n It's also entirely free!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.znanye.com/#", "developer_terms_of_servic